# KIPPER: Sinker Bombs ride in the trail (two from a dock). Sitting still,
# holding the dash button readies the last one and letting go drops it;
# touching the pad first calls it off (no bomb, no dash), and letting go
# before it is ready is a plain dash. A bomb sinks and goes off, breaking
# blue blocks and sealed walls, hitting a big one for 350 and knocking the
# sub if it's close. A dropped bomb can't be picked up again.
seed 1
game kipper
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat clear
cheat calm
cheat fit 3
cheat fit 6
expect trail_charges == 2
cheat tile 56 96
wait 2
hold LEFT 110
wait 20
# held: ready, but nothing drops until it's let go
hold B
wait 30
expect ready_bomb == 1
expect bombs == 0
expect trail_charges == 2
release B
wait 2
expect bombs == 1
expect trail_charges == 1
hold UP+LEFT 60
wait 120
expect bombs == 0
expect tile_49_98 == 46
# the pad touched while holding: called off, no bomb and no dash
cheat tile 70 28
cheat clear
wait 30
cheat fuel 1000
hold B
wait 10
hold UP
wait 2
release UP
wait 20
release B
wait 2
expect bombs == 0
expect trail_charges == 1
expect fuel >= 990
# let go too soon: a dash
press B 5
expect dash > 0
expect fuel <= 820
# a bomb never comes back into the trail, even swum through
wait 30
hold B 25
wait 2
expect bombs == 1
expect trail_charges == 0
hold DOWN+LEFT 24
hold UP+RIGHT 30
expect trail_charges == 0
# sitting by it when it goes off: a knock
wait 150
expect bombs == 0
expect hits >= 1
# a big one takes 350
cheat dock 0
wait 25
press A
wait 5
press B
wait 5
expect trail_charges == 2
cheat calm
cheat tile 77 138
cheat clear
wait 2
expect boss5_hp == 1400
hold B 25
wait 2
expect bombs == 1
hold UP+LEFT 30
wait 150
expect boss5_hp == 1050
